** BROKEN (rigid-body singularity): NO boundary conditions at all, only an
** external load -> the body has unconstrained rigid-body modes, the stiffness
** matrix is singular (zero pivot) and the static step aborts.
** Expected auto-fix: rigid_body_stabilization adds STABILIZE (viscous damping)
** which regularizes the rigid-body modes so the step solves.
*HEADING
Under-constrained cube - singular
